# Line endings: every text file uses CRLF in the working copy, whatever core.autocrlf says - the
# same rule as in the apps that use this library. The repository itself stores LF.
* text=auto eol=crlf
# The one exception: the POSIX wrapper script. A shell cannot read a script whose lines end in CR,
# and JitPack builds on Linux with ./gradlew.
gradlew text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf

# Binaries - no conversion, no diff.
*.jar binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary